      "content": "The Avalara CertCapture RESTful API provides document management for tax-exempt sales, including managing exemption certificates, customer records, custom attributes, authentication tokens, and eCommerce token generation. It supports the full certificate lifecycle from creation through validation and expiry tracking.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Avalara Developer Relations\n Email: developer.relations@avalara.com",
